Educational Psychology Service Assistant Officer (EDB/SE/185/26)
Entry Requirements:
(a) A Hong Kong bachelor's degree in Psychology, Counselling, Guidance or related disciplines, or equivalent;
(e) Good command of both spoken and written English and Chinese;
(f) Good communication, interpersonal, analytical and organization skills; and
(g) Ability to work independently and as a team to meet requirements.
